    fit: 'You want work that will still exist and still need you in twenty years, and you are willing to specialise to fix the income side of it. The <a href="/blog/medical-careers/career-after-bsc-nursing-india-scope">BSc nursing scope and specialisation path</a> covers exactly which moves raise that ceiling.',
