    caution: 'Pay only compounds if you build something on top of the classroom — a tutoring practice, curriculum or edtech content, or a move into school leadership. If you are weighing this against a corporate path directly, <a href="/blog/career-options/teaching-vs-corporate-career-india-which-to-choose">teaching vs corporate career</a> compares both side by side.',
