  },
  {
    num: '2',
    title: 'Weight security highest',
    body: 'Government and PSU roles, allied health, and government-school teaching lead. Accept a capped ceiling unless you deliberately build a second layer on top of the base role.',
  },
  {
    num: '3',
    title: 'Weight growth trajectory highest',
    body: 'Sales, consulting, and specialist tech again lead, alongside any ownership-track role. The flattest trajectories sit in generalist IT-services work and seniority-only government or administrative posts.',
  },
  {
    num: '4',
    title: 'Weight AI-resilience highest',
    body: 'Nursing and allied health, skilled trades, early-years teaching, and trust-heavy judgment roles lead. The most exposed are generalist IT execution, junior QA, and entry-level analytics — regardless of how modern the title sounds.',
